#   GATE G2 dz/lambda_D: target(cold) 25593, ambient 40.4
#   predicted absorption: tau(flat top) = 3.7e+04, f_abs ~ 1.000; ambient traverse eats 0.000%
#   B0 = 3.007 T   1/wci0 = 3471.8022 ps   rho_i0 = 10877.5 d_e   M_A = 14.73  M_ms = 9.36  (1.30 gyroperiods)
